@startuml
title Digital Watch UML State Machine Diagram

state Start
state TimeView
state AdjustHour
state AdjustMinute
state AlarmOnOff
state AlarmRing
state AlarmStop
state LightOn
state LightOff

[*]Start --> TimeView
TimeView --> AdjustHour: Adjust Hour button press
AdjustHour --> AdjustHour: Increase value button press
AdjustHour --> TimeView: Decrease value button press or AlarmOnOff
AlarmOnOff --> AlarmOnOff: On button press
AlarmOnOff --> AdjustHour: Off button press
AlarmOnOff --> AlarmSet: On and set alarm time
AlarmSet --> AlarmRing: Match current time
AlarmRing --> AlarmStop: Alarm stop button press
AlarmRing --> AlarmRing: No alarm stop button press
LightOn --> LightOn: Light button press
LightOn --> LightOff: Light button release

@enduml
